  <section class="home-section donation-matters"><div class="container"><div class="row align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-6 matters-copy"><h2 class="section-title">Why Blood Donation Matters</h2><p class="section-text">Blood is a critical resource that cannot be manufactured â€” it can only be donated. Every 2 seconds, someone in the world needs blood, whether for surgery, accidents, cancer treatment, or childbirth complications.</p><div class="benefit-list"><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon">â™¡</div><div><h3>One Donation = 3 Lives Saved</h3><p>Each donation is separated into components that help multiple patients.</p></div></div><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon">â—·</div><div><h3>Takes Only 1 Hour</h3><p>The entire process including registration and recovery takes about 60 minutes.</p></div></div><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon">â™™</div><div><h3>Health Benefits for Donors</h3><p>Regular donation reduces risk of heart disease and stimulates blood cell production.</p></div></div></div><a class="button-primary mt-4" href="why_donate_blood.php">Check Your Eligibility</a></div><div class="col-lg-6 mt-5 mt-lg-0"><div class="requirements"><div class="requirement-card"><b>18â€“65</b><strong>Age Range</strong><span>Eligible donor age</span></div><div class="requirement-card"><b>56 days</b><strong>Wait Period</strong><span>Between donations</span></div><div class="requirement-card"><b>50 kg</b><strong>Min. Weight</strong><span>Required to donate</span></div><div class="requirement-card"><b>475 ml</b><strong>Blood Drawn</strong><span>Per donation</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>
